<title>JAPAN: Japan Tobacco -97/98 parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Japan Tobacco -97/98 parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1998</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  2.62 trln	  2.74 trln</p>
<p> Current	    115.00	     136.76</p>
<p> Net		   68.00		79.54</p>
<p> EPS	     34,000.00 yen    39,769.81 yen</p>
